    "body": "**PathPilot Hub v2.14.4 simulation (contributor):** a face + 2D contour job posted from this branch with the new machine entries ran clean on both machine profiles - **770M SIM** (`770m.nc`, cycle time 0:39) and **1100MX SIM** (`1100mx.nc`, 0:38): loaded without errors, ran to M30, spindle 9931 rpm in the HI range as the program's `(SPINDLE 9931 RPM NEEDS THE HIGH BELT RANGE)` note says. The GUI's Setup → Machine list shows all six Tormach entries.\n\nStill to check before ready: a program at ~2500 rpm (the 1100MX names HIGH, the 770M names nothing) and a tap on each (refused by name on the 770M, G84 on the 1100MX).",
