    "body": "**Ready for review** (contributor approved). Final head c61da8e; quick gate on the feat commit showed only the pre-existing failures listed in the description, and the follow-up test commit passes on its own (`tormach_machines`: 5/5, clippy clean). Hub-verified as noted above; no 1100MX/770M on hand for a material cut. Follow-ups found while testing: #265 (refused-post reason erased by hover), #266 (tap gouge check at full diameter). #170 stays open for the non-MX 1100 and plain 770 (Refs).",
